item.description:
@JMonlong has some beef with the VCF format (lol don&#39;t we all!): multiple equivalent representation, over-simplification, impractical; he suggests representations based on mapping directly to the assembly #gi2019
&mdash; Daniel Standage (@byuhobbes) November 7, 2019  Nice talk from @JMonlong about SV genotyping using VG @BenedictPaten at #gi2019 . Certainly a field we need more developments in to include SV in medical fields!
&mdash; Fritz Sedlazeck (@sedlazeck) November 7, 2019
